        ('''`EnteringCreatureFromGraveyardConditionalEffect(OncePerTurnTriggerEffect(new CreateTokenCopyOfTargetPermanentEffect()))` | `Triggers.enters(Triggers.CREATURE, ObjectRelation.ANOTHER_YOU_CONTROL)` | Twilight Diviner. The condition inspects the entering permanent's origin; the once-per-turn wrapper is applied after the condition so ordinary creature entries do not consume the trigger.''',
         '''`new CreateTokenCopyOfTargetPermanentEffect()` with `TriggerOptions.ONE_OR_MORE.withLimit(TriggerLimit.ONCE_EACH_TURN)` | `Triggers.enters(PermanentAllOfPredicate(Triggers.CREATURE, PermanentEnteredOrCastFromZonePredicate(Zone.GRAVEYARD)), ObjectRelation.ANOTHER_YOU_CONTROL)` | Twilight Diviner. The filter inspects the entering permanent's origin, so ordinary creature entries do not consume the once-each-turn limit.'''),
