        ('''`TriggeringCardConditionalEffect(new CardSubtypePredicate(subtype), ReturnToHandEffect.self())` | `Triggers.enters(Triggers.ENCHANTMENT, ObjectRelation.ANOTHER_YOU_CONTROL)` | Trial of Solidarity (CARTOUCHE). Fires for an enchantment entering under the source's controller; gate the subtype with the conditional.''',
         '''`ReturnToHandEffect.self()` | `Triggers.enters(PermanentAllOfPredicate(Triggers.ENCHANTMENT, PermanentHasSubtypePredicate(subtype)), ObjectRelation.ANOTHER_YOU_CONTROL)` | Trial of Solidarity (CARTOUCHE). Fires for an enchantment entering under the source's controller; gate the subtype with the filter.'''),
